Package: veltos-boot
Architecture: all
Depends: plymouth,
         plymouth-themes,
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: VeltOS boot experience
 Makes start-up look like VeltOS from the first second:
  * "veltos" Plymouth theme (logo with a spinner, like Windows), made the
    default boot splash;
  * "veltos" GRUB theme and boot defaults for installed systems: "VeltOS"
    menu entries, quiet boot with the splash, Windows and other systems
    detected for the boot menu.
